  "kind": "usage",
  "description": "Identity and other non-allowlisted attributes on points and resource (user.email, installation.id, active_approval_mode, prompt_id, user.id, organization.id, auth_type, host.name, os.type) are never copied into any event, spool or state; only session.id, model and type (and auth_type, in memory) are read. The planted auth_type is not vertex-ai or gemini-api-key, so the event has tokens only: no cost_usd, estimated: false (ADR-0016 Changes R6).",
  "contract": "ADR-0016 §3 Parser (\"only their session.id, model and type attributes\"); Gemini telemetry doc (\"session.id, installation.id, active_approval_mode, and user.email ... common attributes on all data\"); spec §12 (MUST drop user.email and any *.email in L0); ADR-0016 Changes R4 (series hash in memory only), R6 (auth_type allowlisted in memory, never copied; any other auth_type → tokens only); ADR-0016 Changes 2026-10-29 (S5b review V1) R5 (estimated: false, exact token counts) and R6 (cost only for auth_type vertex-ai / gemini-api-key)",
